              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff'>Explore individual sleep duration, variability, and weekday patterns across eligible study observations.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' underline='true'>HOW TO INTERPRET</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff'>Blue: Above-average sleep</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff'>Grey: Below-average sleep</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff'>Orange dashed line: 7-hour threshold</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' underline='true'>DATA NOTE</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff'>Observations follow source-record order rather than calendar dates.</run>
